  "_about": "The simplified legend on each key cap, for drawings of the instrument (the companion app's face-on drawing, #333). Keys by their id in keymap.json. A key is either 'lines' (one or more short words, each [text, ink]) or a 'glyph' (play, stop, rec, left, right) with its 'ink'. 'ink' is 'brown' or 'green': which of the two the element is on docs/design/reference/lookalike-model.jpg (its orange-brown is brown); the tones are the drawing's own. Icons that sit beside a word, and the A-Z letter boxes, are dropped. Keys not listed (the two note rows) carry no legend.",
